invariant: INV-38
file: io.c
catches: unit
reason: a record longer than all of cfg.buf gets internal_error whether or
  not this side sent its record_size_limit, so a peer over the limit this
  side advertised gets no record_overflow, which RFC 8449 §4 requires.
  bin/unit requires record_overflow under limit_sent.

--- old
        *alert = t->limit_sent ? ALERT_RECORD_OVERFLOW : ALERT_INTERNAL_ERROR;
--- new
        *alert = ALERT_INTERNAL_ERROR;
